# Release — local green first

Before cutting or pushing any `v*` release tag / `chore: release` commit:

1. Run `pnpm build` (CI `beforeBuildCommand`; catches `tsc` unused / type errors).
2. Run `cargo check --features qwen-local` in `src-tauri`.
3. Prefer `pnpm tauri build --features qwen-local --bundles app` once when touching packaging.

**Do not** push the tag hoping CI will find the break. Authority: `doc/RELEASE.md` → **Hard rule — local green before push**.
